  "content": "![鑄造藥水指南](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3043199b3b68babbd8c4bd8762e393753bd3bc01.png)\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n  <p>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/devav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/636bbebeeb86361b6c3672ae2811673d645ec08c.png\" width=\"200\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 上下載\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/devav/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b74cf8f9bc167120468ea968ba0e77c63fdfdaeb.png\" width=\"220\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 上可用\" />\n    </a>\n        <a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/user/devav/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0028f46ca798440db511e04046ae854c657ecb73.png\" width=\"200\" alt=\"在 MCPEDL 上下載\" />\n    </a>\n  </p>\n\n  <p align=\"center\">\n        <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/devav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d51d446fa425b6205dc3b08a1c9430ec31b2f59c.png\" width=\"250\" alt=\"支持我一個 KOFI\" />\n    </a>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1359411?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=f16436&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\" />\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1359411?style=for-the-badge&label=MCPEDL&color=00a859&logo=data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"MCPEDL 下載數\" />\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n# 每次都查 Wiki 令人煩倦？\n這款視覺指南整合了所有藥水配方到您的遊戲介面中，無論您是大師煉金師還是新手，每個藥水（包括煙霧、滲透和增強版）都能提供清晰易讀的參考，當您需要時直接顯示。\n\n ![brewing guide](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3aea8e3a8dd8b5da9480b6a7c0a0cfacd777a2c0.png)\n\n \n\n藥水或鑄造指南缺乏的物品我們已在製備表中：所有必需的藥水以提升其耐久度、讓它們可投擲。如果您是 Minecraft 新手或總是想知道如何在 Minecraft 中製作某類藥水，加入此資訊到 UI 中的資源包將使您不再需要它們。\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<h2><font color=\"#F0C75E\">免責聲明</font></h2>\n\n如果您錄屏並展示此資源包，請務必保留原始的 <font color=\"#1FA458\">Modrinth 鏈接</font>。\n\n請勿放置直接鏈接或自定義鏈接。\n\n<h3><font color=\"#72D98C\">非常感謝。</font></h3>\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center;\">\n\n\n  <p>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/ready-crops-animated-highlighter-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/raZ5aGa.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 上下載\" />\n    </a>\n  </p>\n</div>",
